From: Maoweicao <Maoweicao@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 18:25:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(i18n): add core translation engine

- Add TranslationManager singleton with JSON-based locale loading
- Add init_i18n() with priority: KIAUH_LANG env >  > settings > en fallback
- Add _() translation function with format string support
- Add get_available_languages() and get_current_language() helpers
---
 kiauh/core/i18n/__init__.py    | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 kiauh/core/i18n/translation.py | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 116 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 kiauh/core/i18n/__init__.py
 create mode 100644 kiauh/core/i18n/translation.py

diff --git a/kiauh/core/i18n/__init__.py b/kiauh/core/i18n/__init__.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..eb9324b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/kiauh/core/i18n/__init__.py
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ======================================================================= #
+#  Copyright (C) 2020 - 2026 Dominik Willner <th33xitus@gmail.com>        #
+#                                                                         #
+#  This file is part of KIAUH - Klipper Installation And Update Helper    #
